<title>INDIA: India Crompton to sign MoU with US firm.</title>
<headline>India Crompton to sign MoU with US firm.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian electrical engineering firm Crompton Greaves Ltd. said it would sign an agreement on Tuesday with America's Allied Signal International Inc., for the development of large-rating transformers.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased to advise that Crompton Greaves will sign an MoU with Allied Signal International Inc, for joint development of conventional and dry type amorphous metal transformers of large KVA ratings,&quot; the firm's Vice-President (Communications and Market Support), A. Dasgupta, said.</p>
<p>Dasgupta added that the transformer production would be targeted at both Indian and export markets.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
